    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><br><strong>Survive with her!</strong><br><br>You've been through an unfortunate plane crash.<br>Luckily, you survived, but ended up being stranded on a deserted island.<br>But there is still hope. 'Cause you're not alone<br>Can you survive and escape from the deserted island with her?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301900/extras/d6cfad0cfc162583cf26b0e643b0df89.avif?t=1709959637\" /></span><br><br>You have to manage your health, stamina, hunger and thirst. When your health reaches 0, it's game over.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choice</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301900/extras/Selection.PNG?t=1709959637\" /></span><br><br>You will be given options during the conversation. One choice won't bring a big change, but your reputation will gradually change.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini game</h2><br>Your survival skills will be tested. Several mini-games are prepared, and the more you become proficient, the better you will survive.",
